{"id":"comrat","name":"科姆拉特","en":"Comrat","country":"Moldova","lat":46.3003,"lng":28.6572,"dek":"加告兹人的黑马之城，南摩尔多瓦的酒乡","history":"科姆拉特的名字可能来自加告兹语里的“黑马”，当地传说中，这匹黑马是城镇的象征，也是财富的标志。这片土地先后留下过青铜时代的聚落遗迹和游牧民族的墓葬。1775年，一张摩尔多瓦地图上已经标出了名为“Cumrad”的定居点。\n\n俄国在1806至1812年战争后兼并此地，随后颁布法令，从多瑙河对岸迁入不同民族。加告兹人和保加利亚人从奥斯曼帝国南下，成为科姆拉特人口的主体，摩尔多瓦人、乌克兰人、希腊人和少量犹太人也陆续到来。到19世纪末，俄国民俗学家莫什科夫记录下这个“有一万居民的大商村”，俄国人开玩笑叫它“加告兹的首都”。\n\n1905年初，社会主义革命者安德烈·加拉桑在加告兹人支持下发动起义，短暂建立了科姆拉特共和国。一战后此地归属罗马尼亚王国，1926年获得城镇地位，并开始使用自己的印章。苏联时期，这里的工业以黄油、葡萄酒和带摩尔多瓦纹样的地毯为主。苏联解体前后，科姆拉特成为自 proclaim 的加告兹共和国首都，如今是加告兹自治区的行政中心。","culture":"科姆拉特是加告兹人的文化中心。官方语言是加告兹语，多数居民仍以它为母语，俄罗斯语同样通行。街头的语言切换、东正教节庆和集市上的方言，让这座小城保有不同于摩尔多瓦其他城市的节奏。当地俄罗斯人曾戏称它为“加告兹的首都”，这个称呼沿用至今。\n\n南摩尔多瓦的酿酒传统也塑造了科姆拉特。城市周边散布着多家酿酒厂，麝香葡萄和红酒是这一带的名产。酿酒季里，城郊的酒窖和加工厂比市中心更忙碌。2002年，科姆拉特国立大学成立，为这个自治区培养了本地人才，也让加告兹语言和文化有了更多被记录的机会。","pull":"一匹黑马，一座酒乡，一种语言守着一座城。","sights":[{"name":"科姆拉特国立大学","orig":"Komrat Devlet Universiteti","intro":"加告兹地区的高等学府，2002年建校，校名同时使用加告兹语和俄语。校园不大，却是本地年轻人离开土地后最先接触城市生活的地方。楼里的语言课堂和走廊上的学生展览，比任何纪念碑都更直接地呈现加告兹文化的当下状态。","img":{"u":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/5c/Universitatea_de_Stat_din_Comrat.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","w":960,"h":766},"src":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Comrat_State_University"},{"name":"科姆拉特共和国历史遗迹","orig":"Comrat Cumhuriyeti","intro":"1905年1月，安德烈·加拉桑在加告兹人支持下发动起义，短暂宣告成立科姆拉特共和国。这段历史没有留下宏大的建筑，更多散落在地方志和街名里。对想了解加告兹人政治记忆的旅行者，这条线索比单一景点更有分量。","img":null,"src":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E7%A7%91%E5%A7%86%E6%8B%89%E7%89%B9%E5%85%B1%E5%92%8C%E5%9B%BD"},{"name":"亚尔普格河畔","orig":"Râul Ialpug","intro":"亚尔普格河从科姆拉特城中穿过，河面不宽，水流平缓。沿岸是本地人散步和钓鱼的地方，夏天傍晚尤其安静。河把城市分成两半，也把酒厂、市场和居民区串在一起，是理解科姆拉特日常尺度的一条线。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/cb/Comrat%2CIalpug.jpg/960px-Comrat%2CIalpug.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":646},"src":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ialpug"},{"name":"维克托·穆姆吉耶夫体育场","orig":"Victor Mumjiev Stadium","intro":"科姆拉特两支足球队的主场，以本地人名命名。看台规模不大，比赛日却能把周围街区的注意力聚过来。对不赶行程的旅行者，看一场本地联赛比逛纪念品店更能感受这座小城的节奏。","img":null,"src":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Victor_Mumjiev_Stadium"},{"name":"科姆拉特市集","orig":"Komrat pazaryeri","intro":"城市日常生活的中心之一，加告兹语、俄语和罗马尼亚语在摊位之间交替。夏季有本地麝香葡萄和家庭自酿红酒，冬季则是腌菜和奶制品。市场没有游客化的包装，却能一次看到科姆拉特人的饮食和语言习惯。","img":null,"src":null}],"foods":[{"name":"麝香葡萄酒","orig":"Muscat","intro":"科姆拉特所在的南摩尔多瓦酿酒区以麝香葡萄和红酒出名，城郊散布着多家酿酒厂。麝香葡萄酒香气浓，适合配本地奶酪和干果。酿酒季在当地酒厂或市场摊位上能买到新酒。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/1f/Muscat_blanc_et_Muscat_noir_by_JM_Rosier.jpg/960px-Muscat_blanc_et_Muscat_noir_by_JM_Rosier.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":1440},"src":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E9%BA%9D%E9%A6%99%E8%91%A1%E8%90%84"},{"name":"加告兹馅饼","orig":"Gözleme","intro":"加告兹饮食里常见的薄面馅饼，在平锅上烙熟，馅料有奶酪、土豆或肉末。科姆拉特的市场和家庭餐桌上都能见到，趁热吃，配一杯红茶或本地红酒。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d0/G%C3%B6zleme.JPG/960px-G%C3%B6zleme.JPG?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":720},"src":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/G%C3%B6zleme"},{"name":"红菜汤","orig":"Borș","intro":"摩尔多瓦和加告兹地区常见的酸味红菜汤，用甜菜、卷心菜和肉煮成，上桌时加酸奶油。科姆拉特的食堂和小餐馆常年供应，冬天配黑面包最实在。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a7/Borscht_served.jpg/960px-Borscht_served.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":627},"src":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E7%BD%97%E5%AE%8B%E6%B1%A4"},{"name":"萨尔马","orig":"Sarma","intro":"卷心菜叶包肉和米饭，慢炖后带酸香，是摩尔多瓦和巴尔干地区共有的家常菜。科姆拉特的市场熟食摊和家庭餐桌上都能找到，通常配酸奶油和玉米糊一起吃。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f9/Yaprak_sarma%2C_Kayseri_style.jpg/960px-Yaprak_sarma%2C_Kayseri_style.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":720},"src":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Stuffed_leaves"}],"hero":[{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a8/MD.GE.Comrat_-_Catedrala_Sf._Ioan_Botez%C4%83torul_-_jun_2017.jpg/1280px-MD.GE.Comrat_-_Catedrala_Sf._Ioan_Botez%C4%83torul_-_jun_2017.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":1280,"h":720},{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a0/Lenin_statue_in_Comrat.jpg/1280px-Lenin_statue_in_Comrat.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":1280,"h":720}],"outline":{"type":"Polygon","coordinates":[[[28.556851,46.3531618],[28.5875636,46.331225],[28.597177,46.3228386],[28.5876332,46.293877],[28.589456,46.2933067],[28.5924004,46.2853049],[28.6004088,46.2482019],[28.6671663,46.2587894],[28.667772,46.2610911],[28.6703736,46.2615585],[28.6714191,46.2674645],[28.672773,46.2690066],[28.6802961,46.2704718],[28.6844917,46.2742858],[28.6845031,46.2755549],[28.6885601,46.2732627],[28.6930725,46.2740323],[28.694318,46.2682454],[28.6978969,46.2663316],[28.6980558,46.2699556],[28.7007175,46.2705518],[28.6998482,46.2742411],[28.7021627,46.2747671],[28.7034357,46.2718411],[28.7054124,46.272256],[28.7072852,46.2741996],[28.713376,46.271028],[28.7222483,46.2723147],[28.727318,46.2685251],[28.7326295,46.2693237],[28.7359613,46.2945063],[28.7363082,46.3064509],[28.7276233,46.3150245],[28.7624976,46.3214197],[28.7615224,46.3244244],[28.7626636,46.3245679],[28.7597516,46.3348409],[28.7580547,46.3348853],[28.7545055,46.34993],[28.7513865,46.3546069],[28.7512203,46.356275],[28.7530159,46.3594284],[28.7518278,46.3627304],[28.7527583,46.3681123],[28.759143,46.3880583],[28.7592361,46.3966486],[28.756145,46.4090053],[28.7568402,46.4126833],[28.7533492,46.4130517],[28.7439342,46.4176035],[28.7406252,46.4154624],[28.7419449,46.4079731],[28.7363693,46.3983214],[28.7023918,46.3932135],[28.6825983,46.3771185],[28.6812428,46.3650123],[28.678627,46.3618073],[28.6746147,46.3598415],[28.6632847,46.3595332],[28.6621811,46.3584332],[28.6599449,46.3624465],[28.6577201,46.3620442],[28.6558563,46.365453],[28.6546889,46.3654703],[28.6509446,46.3687023],[28.6511498,46.3697152],[28.649513,46.3697265],[28.6499195,46.3706615],[28.6401926,46.3833242],[28.5690888,46.3721571],[28.556851,46.3531618]]]},"credit":{"model":"deepseek-flash","wiki":{"zh":"科姆拉特","en":"Comrat","voyage":null}}}